Contains the information_theory package used in the analysis.
To use: 
1. Download whole folder
2. Ensure __init__.py is present; if not, create __init__.py and keep in this folder so Python can read this folder as a packaged.
3. In main script, run these lines to import package:
from .Entropy import entropy, discretize_if_needed
from .Joint_Entropy import joint_entropy
from .Mutual_Information import mutual_information
from .Conditional_Mutual_Information import conditional_mutual_information
from .Causation_Entropy import causation_entropy
